已核实旧实现loop.py:2002-2021四条规则：(1)剥完整<think>…</think>；(2)剥未闭合<think>到buffer尾；(3)剥孤儿</think>到buffer尾；(4)holdback尾部『最后一个<之后无>』。且raw_stream_buffer在_run_agent_loop函数级初始化(:1991)跨tool-iteration累积——状态机实例必须同样放函数级跨iteration复用。

状态设计（三态+尾缓冲）：outside / inside_think / suppressed（孤儿</think>后永久抑制到turn结束，对应规则3）；_pending=可能还会长成完整tag的尾巴（对应规则2与4的holdback）。loop.py模块级新增：
```python
class _ThinkStripStreamer:
    """Incremental equivalent of the old _visible_stream_text full-buffer regexes."""
    _OPEN, _CLOSE = "<think>", "</think>"
    def __init__(self) -> None:
        self._in_think = False
        self._suppressed = False
        self._pending = ""
    def feed(self, delta: str) -> str:
        if self._suppressed:
            return ""
        buf, self._pending = self._pending + delta, ""
        out: list[str] = []
        i = 0
        while i < len(buf):
            if self._in_think:
                idx = buf.find(self._CLOSE, i)
                if idx < 0:
                    return "".join(out)  # think内全隐藏，无需保尾（旧regex同语义）
                i, self._in_think = idx + len(self._CLOSE), False
                continue
            lt = buf.find("<", i)
            if lt < 0:
                out.append(buf[i:]); return "".join(out)
            out.append(buf[i:lt])
            gt = buf.find(">", lt)
            if gt < 0:
                self._pending = buf[lt:]  # 规则4 holdback
                return "".join(out)
            token = buf[lt:gt + 1]
            if token == self._OPEN:
                self._in_think, i = True, gt + 1
            elif token == self._CLOSE:
                self._suppressed = True  # 规则3：孤儿</think>抑制其后一切
                return "".join(out)
            else:
                out.append(token); i = gt + 1  # 普通'<..>'原样通过
        return "".join(out)
```
_run_agent_loop改法：删除raw_stream_buffer/emitted_stream_len（已核实:1991-2019外无其他使用），:2002-2021替换为：
